  zipball_url: 'https://api.github.com/repos/jp7677/dxvk-nvapi/zipball/v0.9.1',
  body: '# Changelog\r\n' +
    '\r\n' +
    '- Add DRS environment variables for overriding DLSS SR/RR scaling ratio, see [Passing driver settings](https://github.com/jp7677/dxvk-nvapi/wiki/Passing-driver-settings).\r\n' +
    "- Fake successes for Reflex API calls  when DXVK-NVAPI's Vulkan Reflex layer is not installed for DOOM: The Dark Ages to workaround a pink tint issue.\r\n" +
    '- Add several DRS function stubs to prevent Godot engine based titles from crashing at startup.\r\n' +
    '- Add a work around for The Last of Us Part 2 by letting several GPU queries return success, even when no real data is available. This allows this title to start when NVAPI is available.\r\n' +
    '- Fix a startup crash for Middle-earth: Shadow of Mordor by implementing `NvAPI_D3D1x_Present`.\r\n' +
    '- Report Reflex being unavailable for Stormgate to prevent a crash when opening the in-game map editor.\r\n' +
    '- Improve Vulkan layer logging.\r\n' +
    '- Internal improvements.\r\n' +
    '\r\n' +
    '## Header updates\r\n' +
    '\r\n' +
    '- Update NVAPI headers to R590.\r\n' +
    '- Update NVML headers to R590.\r\n' +
    '- Update Vulkan headers to 1.4.321.\r\n' +
    '- Update DirectX headers to 1.616.0.\r\n' +
    '- Update vkroots headers to g51c3213.',
